#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: wc-sku-ean-comparator.php
msgid "https://github.com/sjbdigital/wc-sku-ean-comparator"
msgstr "https://github.com/sjbdigital/wc-sku-ean-comparator"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wc-sku-ean-comparator.php
msgid "Import price lists (CSV/XLS/XLSX) and compare products against WooCommerce catalog by SKU, EAN and name. Generates output CSV files with match results."
msgstr "Importuje cenníky (CSV/XLS/XLSX) a porovnáva produkty s katalógom WooCommerce podľa SKU, EAN a názvu. Generuje výstupné CSV súbory s výsledkami zhody."

#. Author of the plugin
